      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "经过“天皇赏（春）”的激战，\n北部玄驹的身体也累积了疲劳。\n她本人却没有发现。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7387f34a47e077d5072012daa6bdf6619494fa0dbe351acda73324c2af983de8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
